/ActualText (Co-managed the evolution of the Particles Design System from an ad-hoc UI kit into a scalable, versioned system, now at v5.0.\n\nLed the design of an AI banking assistant that lets users send money and apply for products through in-chat widgets.\n\nDesigned omnichannel financial products across web, mobile, and emerging platforms including AR/VR.\n\nLed the design of out-of-the-box configurations for our white-label banking product, expanding its capabilities and speeding up adaptation to client needs across 6 geographies.\n\nHelped design low-code tools for customizing and managing digital banking channels in minutes, saving project configuration time.\n\nAuthored product documentation and built a centralized repository for cross-team use, reducing documentation time from weeks to days.)
/K [17]
/S /Span
/Type /StructElem
/P 752 0 R
/Pg 5 0 R
